<title>HUNGARY: CESI index plummets, ends at 1,418.37 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index plummets, ends at 1,418.37 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 21.00 points or 1.46 percent to end at 1,418.37 points on Thursday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
